I highly recommend this.  The purpose is to practice techniques for
getting out of fights; getting into them is really easy.  If you can
show up in Minetown with enough zorkmids to get your naked AC to 1, buy
it from the priest, then wield your weapons and start hammering
monsters.  You will not believe the difference it makes in the game!
People have had long and voiciferous debates about whether this is a
must-do to win; let's not go there again.  But it is really worth
experiencing.



